AndroWish on the platform API instead of the support library.

AndroWish compiles against a prebuilt android-support-v4.jar for three
things the platform has had since API 23 (the app needs 26): a
notification builder, requestPermissions, and the permission-result
callback that Activity already declares. Using the platform keeps
binary jars out of the build.

